  "comments": "<p>José Maria da Silva Paranhos Júnior (1845 - 1912), Baron of Rio Branco, &nbsp;was a statesman, diplomat, and historian.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>50 Centavos de Real coin, with reverse of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer ugc\" href=\"/1049\">N#1049</a> (die is 1mm smaller).</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>According to Casa da Moeda (minthouse) up to 40 000 coins may show this error, that is equal to the production of one press in 2 hours. The error was discovered after a mule coin was received as change at Rio de Janeiro city. Techincal search determined is a production error.</p>",
